# cloak/fur_front: the fur mantle's collar: a thick ring of fur round the neck and over the shoulders, meeting at a brass clasp.
# Rigid (its own channel, so it never vanishes on a frame's hang key): facing down it lies over the shoulders above the
# arms (the head layer, under the head); facing right and left it wraps the near shoulder; facing up the panel (drawn
# after, in cloakFront) covers the shoulder caps it keeps there. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role cloak fur
layer head
anchor neck
keys cloakfront
z -5
legend Q cloak 0
legend R cloak 1
legend S cloak 2
legend T cloak 3
legend U cloak 4

view U key rest origin 9 0 layer head
|..QQQQ......QQQQ..
|.QTTSQ......QSSRQ.

view D key rest origin 9 2 layer head
|...ffff....ffff...
|..fiijhf..fhhggf..
|.fiijihhffhhhgggf.
|fiijiihhPOhhhghggf
|fhiihhgf..fhhggggf
|.ffhgf......fgfff.

view R key rest origin 8 2
|...ffff.......
|.fiijhhff..ff.
|fiijiihhhffhgf
|fhiihhhhhhhggf
|.fhhgghhggff..
|..ffffffff....

view L key rest origin 5 2
|.......ffff...
|.ff..ffhhhggf.
|fihffhhhgghggf
|fiihhhhhhhgghf
|..ffiihhiihhf.
|....ffffffff..

# (INTEGRATION 2026-10-23, `walk`: the walk clips only) her walk's passing frames (hang=rest): the back edge 1 px in, inside her
# narrower body (B11 W8: the man's stood 1-4 columns past her box); the front edge as his.
view L key rest origin 5 2 when woman,walk replace
